      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T19:16:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s what I had initially done but it results in extra (unnecessary) calls to `fdt_path_offset` (which walks the DT). For example, consider\n```\nnode \u003d fdt.path_offset(\"/some/path\");\nfdt.appendprop(node, \"prop1\", value1);\nfdt.appendprop(node, \"prop2\", value2);\nfdt.add_subnode(node, \"name\");\n```\n\nBTW, this comment is now outdated as `NodeOffset::fdt` prevents us from modifying the DT  while we hold the offset (which results in the awkward dance in vmbase/example/src/main.rs, line 165).",
